# Quality Management Policy

**Document Type:** Corporate Policy
**Authority Level:** 1 (Authoritative)
**Policy Number:** POL-008
**Effective Date:** January 1, 2024
**Last Reviewed:** January 2026
**Owner:** Chief Quality Officer
**Classification:** Internal

---

## Quality Commitment

Nexus Industries is committed to delivering products and services that meet or exceed customer expectations. Quality is embedded in everything we do, from design through delivery and support.

---

## Scope

This policy applies to:
- All products and services
- All divisions and business units
- All employees involved in quality-affecting activities
- Suppliers and partners delivering to Nexus specifications

---

## Quality Principles

| Principle | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Customer Focus** | Understand and exceed customer requirements |
| **Right First Time** | Prevent defects, don't inspect them out |
| **Continuous Improvement** | Always seek better performance |
| **Data-Driven** | Decisions based on facts and data |
| **Everyone's Responsibility** | Quality is not just the QA department |

