## Nonconformance Management

### Classification

| Class | Description | Disposition |
|-------|-------------|-------------|
| Critical | Safety/airworthiness | Scrap or MRB |
| Major | Function affected | MRB review |
| Minor | Cosmetic/minor function | Use-as-is possible |

### Disposition Options

| Disposition | Authority |
|-------------|-----------|
| Use-as-is | MRB (minor) |
| Rework | Quality Manager |
| Repair | MRB |
| Scrap | Quality Manager |
| Return to Supplier | Procurement + Quality |

### Material Review Board (MRB)

| Member | Role |
|--------|------|
| Quality Manager | Chair |
| Engineering | Technical |
| Manufacturing | Process |
| Customer Rep (if required) | Customer interest |

