## Corrective and Preventive Action

### CAPA Process

| Step | Action | Timeframe |
|------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Identify problem | Immediate |
| 2 | Contain | <24 hours |
| 3 | Root cause analysis | <7 days |
| 4 | Corrective action plan | <14 days |
| 5 | Implement | Per plan |
| 6 | Verify effectiveness | <30 days |
| 7 | Prevent recurrence | <60 days |

### Triggers

| Trigger | Response |
|---------|----------|
| Customer complaint | CAPA required |
| Internal nonconformance | Per severity |
| Audit finding | CAPA required |
| Process deviation | Investigation |
| Trend analysis | Preventive action |

